    V_DM="sddm"
    V_SESSION="hurunagus"
    V_APPLY="rpm-ostree"
    V_DESC="Flagship hurunagus image — Fedora bootc on an ublue base"
    V_NOTES=$'Adoption payload ships in the image\'s /etc/skel (Omarchy dotfiles, hypr/*.lua, shell.json, branding).\nShips the unsigned kernel-cachyos kernel: with Secure Boot on, a MOK must be enrolled by hand.'
