    V_DE="niri + DMS"
    V_DM="gdm"
    V_SESSION=""
    V_APPLY="rpm-ostree"
    V_DESC="Hurunagus Silverblue (BlueBuild) — niri + DMS on the GNOME base"
    V_NOTES=$'greetd is commented out in the recipe, so the base image\'s GDM is what greets you.\nPublished F44 tags: confirm the target is not older than the running system before rebasing.'
